<title>ITALY: Italy Senate delays TV body talks until after Xmas.</title>
<headline>Italy Senate delays TV body talks until after Xmas.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's upper house Senate public works commission has delayed until after Christmas the examination of a draft law aimed at setting up an authority for the Italian telecoms and TV industry.</p>
<p>&quot;We will not discuss the draft law for the authority until after Christmas, the negotiations for now are suspended,&quot; Senator Carlo Rognoni told reporters.</p>
<p>The Senate has instead scheduled for next week a draft law to extend TV broadcasting concessions, added Rognoni.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
